{"id":"n46814-3-7","stage":1,"title":"코 · 尖头","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n46814-3-7-1","ko":"신발이 왜 그렇게 지저분해?","zh":"鞋怎么这么脏？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"신발이","meaning":"鞋","explanation":"신발：鞋；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"신발","audio":"/audio/514d3c6f08937125aef8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30213","senseId":"1","lemma":"신발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지저분해?","meaning":"脏兮兮，肮脏","explanation":"지저분하다：脏兮兮，肮脏；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"지저분하다","audio":"/audio/8db48a7863a37c7a29f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27948","senseId":"2","lemma":"지저분하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"514d3c6f08937125","term":"신발","zh":"鞋","audio":"/audio/514d3c6f08937125aef8.mp3","entryId":"30213","definition":"站立或走路时为了保护脚而穿的东西。","pronunciation":["신발"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"8db48a7863a37c7a","term":"지저분하다","zh":"脏兮兮，肮脏","audio":"/audio/8db48a7863a37c7a29f1.mp3","entryId":"27948","definition":"不干净且脏得让人讨厌。","pronunciation":["지저분하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f3e598bff10966813ecf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n46814-3-7-2","ko":"운동장을 걸어왔는데 코에 흙이 이렇게 많이 묻었는지 몰랐어요.","zh":"我走过操场，都没发现鞋头沾了这么多土。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"운동장을","meaning":"运动场，体育场","explanation":"운동장：运动场，体育场；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동장","audio":"/audio/899e5787d5587fd1d0c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26891","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸어왔는데","meaning":"走","explanation":"걸어오다：走；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"걸어오다","audio":"/audio/882df61970721559170e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64368","senseId":"2","lemma":"걸어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"코에","meaning":"尖头，尖儿","explanation":"코：尖头，尖儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"코","audio":"/audio/f4f759edb468db531ae2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46814","senseId":"3","lemma":"코","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"흙이","meaning":"土，土壤","explanation":"흙：土，土壤；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"흙","audio":"/audio/fe84d047fd5593204ab9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73254","senseId":"1","lemma":"흙","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"묻었는지","meaning":"沾上","explanation":"묻다：沾上；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"묻다","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46165","senseId":"1","lemma":"묻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몰랐어요.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"899e5787d5587fd1","term":"운동장","zh":"运动场，体育场","audio":"/audio/899e5787d5587fd1d0c4.mp3","entryId":"26891","definition":"为能够进行体育比赛、游玩等而设有多种器具或设施的宽阔场所。","pronunciation":["운ː동장"]},{"id":"882df61970721559","term":"걸어오다","zh":"走","audio":"/audio/882df61970721559170e.mp3","entryId":"64368","definition":"为了到达目的地而经过某路。","pronunciation":["거러오다"]},{"id":"f4f759edb468db53","term":"코","zh":"尖头，尖儿","audio":"/audio/f4f759edb468db531ae2.mp3","entryId":"46814","definition":"鞋子前端尖尖地突出来的部分。","pronunciation":["코"]},{"id":"fe84d047fd559320","term":"흙","zh":"土，土壤","audio":"/audio/fe84d047fd5593204ab9.mp3","entryId":"73254","definition":"覆盖于地球表面、由小颗粒组成的物质。","pronunciation":["흑"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"ed5c4f65f9f1771c","term":"묻다","zh":"沾上","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3","entryId":"46165","definition":"黏上灰尘、污垢、粉末或液体等。","pronunciation":["묻따"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2b99f4ec108cb35e72d5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.817,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=46814","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":53,"sequenceScore":2.3305,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我走过操场，都没发现鞋头沾了这么多土。","鞋怎么这么脏？","我化了妆有那么奇怪吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["鞋怎么这么脏？","我化了妆有那么奇怪吗？","我走过操场，都没发现鞋头沾了这么多土。"],"answer":2}]}
